  "title": "Same newsletter create multiple feeds",
  "summary": "I have lots of newsletters forwarded into NewsBlur and it creates a feed for each incoming source email, which is what I want, the problem is it believes the same email containing an alias is considered as different emails and therefore creates different feeds for same origin. For instance I am subscribed to a newsletter called hipersonica, they send emails from: hipersonica@substack.com ← original address hipersonica+valladolid@substack.com hipersonica+tier-list@substack.com hipersonica+bu...",
